@startuml RestroVibes - Appointment Lifecycle
!theme plain
title RestroVibes - Appointment Lifecycle & State Machine

actor Client
actor Restaurateur
participant "Express API" as API
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "ScoringEngine" as Score
participant "Overstay Worker\n(every 60s)" as OW

== STATE MACHINE ==

note over Client,OW
  pending ──> accepted ──> in_progress ──> completed
     │           │              │
     │           │              └──> completed (overstayed)
     │           └──> no_show (never arrived)
     └──> cancelled
end note

== RESTAURATEUR: CONFIRM APPOINTMENT ==

Restaurateur -> API : PUT /api/appointments/:id/confirm
API -> DB : Verify appointment.restaurateurId == caller.id
API -> DB : UPDATE status -> "accepted"
API --> Restaurateur : 200 Confirmed

== RESTAURATEUR: MARK ARRIVAL ==

Restaurateur -> API : PUT /api/appointments/:id/arrived
API -> DB : Fetch appointment (scheduledTime)
API -> API : diffMinutes = (now - scheduledTime) / 60000

alt Client is > 15 minutes late
    API -> DB : UPDATE is_late = true,\nactual_arrival_time = now
    API -> DB : INSERT BookingHistory\n(status = "late_arrival")
    API -> Score : recalculateUserPenalty(clientId)
    Score -> Score : penalty += lateArrivals x 0.4
    Score -> Score : Update: penalty_score,\nreliability_status,\nis_flagged fields
    Score --> API : Updated
else Client arrived on time
    API -> DB : UPDATE actual_arrival_time = now
end

API -> DB : UPDATE status -> "in_progress"
API --> Restaurateur : 200 Marked as arrived

== RESTAURATEUR: COMPLETE APPOINTMENT ==

Restaurateur -> API : PUT /api/appointments/:id/complete
API -> DB : UPDATE status -> "completed"
API -> DB : INSERT BookingHistory\n(status = "completed")
API -> Score : recalculateUserPenalty(clientId)
Score -> Score : penalty -= completed bonus\n(decay factor applied)
Score --> API : Updated
API --> Restaurateur : 200 Completed

== RESTAURATEUR: MARK NO-SHOW ==

Restaurateur -> API : PUT /api/appointments/:id/no-show
API -> DB : UPDATE status -> "no_show"
API -> DB : INSERT BookingHistory\n(status = "no_show")
API -> Score : recalculateUserPenalty(clientId)
Score -> Score : penalty += noShows x 0.7\n(highest weight)
Score --> API : Updated
API --> Restaurateur : 200 Marked as no-show

== CLIENT: REQUEST EXTENSION ==

Client -> API : POST /api/appointments/:id/extend\n{ extra_minutes: 30 }
API -> API : Verify: caller is appointment client
API -> API : Verify: status IN (pending, accepted, in_progress)
API -> API : newEnd = extended_until || end_time\n+ extra_minutes x 60000

API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION (SERIALIZABLE)
API -> DB : SUM(party_size) for overlapping\nappointments at same restaurant\nin extension window [currentEnd, newEnd)
DB --> API : seatsTaken = 12

API -> API : Check: seatsTaken + party_size <= capacity
alt Capacity OK
    API -> DB : UPDATE end_time = newEnd,\nextended_until = nextEnd,\nextension_status = "accepted"
    API -> DB : COMMIT
    API --> Client : 200 Extended successfully
else Not Enough Capacity
    API -> DB : ROLLBACK
    API --> Client : 409 Not enough capacity
end

== CLIENT: CANCEL APPOINTMENT ==

Client -> API : PUT /api/appointments/:id/cancel
API -> DB : Verify: caller is client or admin
API -> DB : UPDATE status -> "cancelled"
API --> Client : 200 Cancelled

== OVERSTAY WORKER (Background) ==

loop Every 60 seconds
    OW -> DB : SELECT in_progress WHERE\nend_time + 10min < NOW()
    DB --> OW : Overstayed appointments

    loop For each overstayed appointment
        OW -> DB : UPDATE status -> "completed"
        OW -> DB : INSERT BookingHistory\n(status = "overstayed")
        OW -> Score : recalculateUserPenalty(clientId)
        Score -> Score : penalty += overstays x 0.15
        Score --> OW : Updated
    end

    OW -> DB : SELECT pending/accepted WHERE\nend_time + grace < NOW()\n(never started)
    DB --> OW : No-show appointments

    loop For each no-show
        OW -> DB : UPDATE status -> "no_show"
        OW -> DB : INSERT BookingHistory\n(status = "no_show")
        OW -> Score : recalculateUserPenalty(clientId)
        Score -> Score : penalty += noShows x 0.7
        Score --> OW : Updated
    end
end

== ADMIN: CANCEL ANY APPOINTMENT ==

Client -> API : PUT /api/appointments/:id/cancel
API -> DB : Verify: caller is admin
API -> API : Admin bypass: no ownership check
API -> DB : UPDATE status -> "cancelled"
API --> Client : 200 Cancelled

@enduml
